  "limitations": [
    "Fixed public bench set: two speakers, synthetic and public-recording noise, one realization per mix. Nothing is held out, and the set can be overfitted; the numbers say what changed on it, not what a stranger's microphone does.",
    "The distractors (TV, music, babble) are synthetic or built from the same two speakers. The sweep varies only their SNR; it is not a cohort.",
    "The current settings are always the factory Preset(). A retake is a stretch of the same noise that played during the take, so it measures a continuous distractor, not a passing one.",
    "The clauses are those of the retired refusal study; the compression-aware reading is new and is checked here only against its own controls (no compressor, a squashing compressor), not against listening.",
    "The Voice Setup tuner reads wall-clock time, so a run on a loaded machine can differ in its choices."
  ]
}
